chunks.text:
You should write because when you know that you’re going to write, it changes the way you live.


Writing needn’t be a formal enterprise to have this effect. You don’t have to write well.

for the shoggoth
Along these lines where LLMs are strangely-shaped tool. Nick did emphasize that this will be “the last humanities project of our time”.



